{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# The Player\n🕹️ The real person who controls Kris through the SOUL — the game itself mechanically confirms they are two separate entities.","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":180,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_SOUL.png","x":0,"y":-220,"width":102,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nThe central relationship: the game confirms again and again that Kris and the Player are two separate entities.","x":-650,"y":300,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_screenshot_kicking_SOUL.png","x":-650,"y":90,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nOne of the few Lightners who consciously senses his presence, even asking out loud during Snowgrave whether it's really Kris acting.","x":-300,"y":300,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":-300,"y":90,"width":90,"height":180},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Routes**\nThe hidden route system itself, invisible to the characters, is direct evidence of the tension between the Player and actual control of the story.","x":60,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/routes.png","x":60,"y":90,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Shadow Crystal**\nThe desire to \"break free of the script\" shared by its bearers reflects the same tension between the Player's control and imposed fate.","x":420,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/ShadowCrystals.png","x":420,"y":90,"width":200,"height":70},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Angel**\nIs the Player, in fact, the Angel of the Prophecy? The most widespread theory in the whole fandom.","x":780,"y":300,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Legend_screenshot_Angel%27s_Heaven.webp","x":780,"y":90,"width":200,"height":113},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Jackenstein**\nHis fight literally confirms, for the first time, that Kris's soul and the Player's are two separate entities.","x":-650,"y":620,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jackenstein_overworld_Halloween_decoration.png","x":-650,"y":850,"width":113,"height":170},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Gaster (W. D. Gaster)**\nThe \"Gaster's List\" theory points to him as the Voice guiding the creation of the first Vessel — internal name GONERMAKER, grayscale palette, shared leitmotif.","x":1140,"y":300,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_gonerkid.webp","x":1140,"y":110,"width":132,"height":170},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Clam Guy**\nHis bond with Clam Girl (\"Clam Goner\") shares the same visual pattern of Gaster possessing or using other people's bodies as vessels.","x":1480,"y":300,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster_gonerclampgirl.webp","x":1480,"y":110,"width":116,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e_c_img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e0i","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e1i","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e2i","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e3i","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e4i","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e5i","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}